  "description": "RAGXIJ crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C114 H80 N8 O18 S4 Yb4,7(C7 H8). From the CIF bond table, Yb1 (Yb) has 6 O neighbors; Yb2 (Yb) has 8 O neighbors; Yb3 (Yb) has 6 O neighbors; Yb4 (Yb) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.519-3.774 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 96.75-111.42°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C114H80N8O18S4Yb4·7(C7H8).",
